    "sections": {
        "description": "Online Notary is a professional, modern, and conversion-focused theme designed for consulting and corporation-level services in the legal and documentation space, including certified online notaries, remote notarization services, legal document verification, electronic notarization, virtual notary appointments, affidavit notarization, real estate document notarization, and financial document notarization. It provides a fully responsive, mobile-friendly, and SEO-optimized platform with clean, structured layouts and intuitive navigation to ensure a seamless user experience. The theme includes dedicated features such as virtual session booking, identity verification, document uploads, pricing sections, and detailed service descriptions, helping establish trust and streamline operations. With WooCommerce compatibility for secure service payments, Contact Form 7 for client inquiries and appointment requests, and Yoast SEO for improved search visibility, it offers a complete solution for managing and growing an online notarization business. Customizable colors, typography, and layout sections allow businesses to align the design with their brand identity, making Online Notary a powerful and efficient platform for delivering professional notary and consulting services online."
    },
